      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test. Key understandability improvements:\n1. Remove 7 unused imports and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant that create noise\n2. Add a brief comment block separating the post-EOF test from the main reading loop, clarifying intentThe improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed 7 unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertNotNull`, `assertThrows`, `assertTrue`, `ParameterizedTest`, `MethodSource`, `StringUtils`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, then added inline comments that divide the test into clear phases (normal reading loop, post-EOF behavior, post-close behavior) so the intent of each assertion group is immediately obvious."
